  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NPC
  dialogue:
    name: Bearded Hippie
    sentences:
    - Little buddy, did you hear?
    - The corner shop near the park have these new gummies on the shelf.
    - They make the mind totally clear, little buddy. I heard they make you feel
      unstoppable, dude!
    - Like, you could get knocked out and stand back up! Well until it wears off,
      of course...
    - If you find any, hook me up with some. I'll give you this sweet [Ice Pendant]
      I found, little buddy.
